OL,3,GNEWSAFarming award joy for teen
OL,4,Ainspired by late grandad
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung farmer William Hunt, 15, pitched
OL,7,Fin to help when his grandfather fell
OL,8,Fill after being diagnosed with
OL,9,Fpancreatic cancer.
OL,11,FDavid Hall died at the age of 78 in
OL,12,FJuly this year.
OL,14,FWilliam lent his support to running the
OL,15,Ffamily's traditional mixed livestock
OL,16,Ffarm in the village of Combs in the
OL,17,FHigh Peak.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
