OL,3,GNEWSAFarming award joy for teen
OL,4,Ainspired by late grandad
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis dedication has seen him named as
OL,7,Fthe UK's young farming hero at a
OL,8,Fnational award ceremony, with judges
OL,9,Fhighlighting "his unwavering support
OL,10,Ffor his family through an incredibly
OL,11,Fdifficult time".
